  "description": "\"May you never even dream of forgiveness in your life.\" Jeje and Chan, infected during the zombie apocalypse, harmed each other's loved ones. Thanks to a cure developed at the center where they were taken, they were healed from zombies back into half-humans and released back into society as 'carriers.' Reunited as roommates in a new home assigned by the government due to their persistent, ill-fated ties, the two attempt to coexist with hearts unable to forgive one another... (Source Lezhin)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/mold_boys), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/mold_boys)",
